{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Remote Detonation stays on its own button across mines (#3965)",
  "contract": [
    "Remote Detonation 801798 requires Bomb Ready 500354 (CasterAuraSpell), which a live Blast Mine 50045 applies to",
    "its owner, so the spell is meant to stay known and be greyed out until a mine is down. AscensionTinker::Refresh",
    "used to teach it as a temporary spell while a mine existed and remove it with the last mine, so every mine",
    "printed 'You have learned a new spell', put another button on the bar up to level 10, and every detonation",
    "printed 'You have unlearned'. Expected: learning Deploy Blast Mine teaches Remote Detonation once and it stays",
    "known; casting it with no mine is refused for the missing aura; over two mines it is never learned or removed",
    "again and prints nothing, while each mine still grants Bomb Ready and is detonated by it."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
